## Patch user email only - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "newmail@example.com"
}

###
## Patch firstName and lastName - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Johnny",
    "lastName": "Doey"
}

###
## Patch username - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "makarena2"
}

###
## Patch password (valid) - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password": "Veryoriginal2!"
}

###
## Empty body, every field optional via PartialType - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
## Unknown property "age" (forbidNonWhitelisted) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "age": 20
}

###
## Unknown property "isAuth" (forbidNonWhitelisted) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "isAuth": true
}

###
## Invalid email format (@IsEmail) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "newmail-at-example"
}

###
## firstName too short, 2 chars (@MinLength(3)) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Jo"
}

###
## username too short, 7 chars (@MinLength(8)) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "makaren"
}

###
## username too long, 26 chars (@MaxLength(25)) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "makarenaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
}

###
## password without special character (@Matches) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "password": "Veryoriginal2"
}

###
## wrong type, email as number (@IsString, @IsEmail) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": 456
}

###
## Non-numeric id (ParseIntPipe) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/not-a-number
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Johnny"
}
